"The obelisk is the tutorial's kiosk; touched, its screen wakes after some seconds of stillness."
"Strange symbols scroll on the kiosk screen a moment, then turn to English."
"The kiosk menu lists Active quests (1), Contestant profile, and System encyclopedia."
"The menu line for the encyclopedia shows (Tutorial knowledge points: 0) beside it."
"The encyclopedia shows only a blank page with a back arrow until knowledge points are spent."
"Knowledge points buy encyclopedia entries on the isle's beasts, plants, hazards and the System."
"The kiosk's quest page shows the time left in the tutorial and until the next phase."
"The obelisk sits in the copperbacks' range, the ground farthest from the ashback's hunting."
